NEXT_PUBLIC_NAME=HydraManga
NEXT_PUBLIC_DESC=HydraManga is a dynamic, community-driven platform where readers can discover, track, review, and discuss manga, manhua, manhwa, and more in one seamless ecosystem. Built for passionate fans HydraManga blends a powerful reading experience with rich social features, profiles, clubs, discussions, recommendations, and personalized libraries, so every user feels part of a thriving community. HydraManga gives you total control over how you discover and read. Earn badges, climb the leaderboards, and join a community that never sleeps. Are you ready to read?
NEXT_PUBLIC_SLOGAN=Unleash your next Obsession.
NEXT_PUBLIC_URL=https://hydramanga.com

# Backend API origin used by Next rewrites and server-side calls
# In Docker, compose sets this to http://server:4000
BACKEND_INTERNAL_URL=http://localhost:4000
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://hydramanga.com/api

# Optional: Google Search Console site verification token
# NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_SITE_VERIFICATION=

BETTER_AUTH_SECRET=
# (legacy) NEXT_PUBLIC_AUTH_URL is not required with rewrites; kept for compatibility
NEXT_PUBLIC_AUTH_URL=http://localhost:3000/api

# Set to "true" to enable DevTools blocking (see public/devtools-guard.js)
NEXT_PUBLIC_BLOCK_DEVTOOLS=true